msgid "A system update is ready. Restart the computer to finish installing it."
msgstr "Tha ùrachadh an t-siostaim deiseil. Ath-thòisich an coimpiutair gus a stàladh a choileanadh."

msgid "System files need repair. This happens automatically the next time the computer restarts."
msgstr "Feumar faidhlichean an t-siostaim a chàradh. Thachras seo gu fèin-obrachail an ath thuras a thèid an coimpiutair ath-thòiseachadh."

msgid "The web browser is not installed yet."
msgstr "Cha deach am brabhsair-lìn a stàladh fhathast."

msgid "The web browser is ready. Sign out and sign in again to see it."
msgstr "Tha am brabhsair-lìn deiseil. Clàraich a-mach is a-steach a-rithist airson fhaicinn."

msgid "This app is not available on this device"
msgstr "Chan eil an aplacaid seo ri fhaighinn air an uidheam seo"

msgid "This app's lock settings are not in effect, so it cannot start. Please ask your teacher."
msgstr "Chan eil roghainnean glasaidh na h-aplacaid seo an sàs, mar sin chan urrainn dhi tòiseachadh. Faighnich dhen tidsear agad."

msgid "Could not end your session. Please sign out and open this app from the sign-in screen."
msgstr "Cha b' urrainn dhuinn an seisean agad a chrìochnachadh. Clàraich a-mach is fosgail an aplacaid seo on sgrìn clàraidh a-steach."

msgid "This will end your session and open %s in locked mode."
msgstr "Crìochnaichidh seo an seisean agad is fosglaidh e %s sa mhodh ghlaiste."

msgid "Newer settings could not be fetched. Please contact IT."
msgstr "Cha b' urrainn dhuinn roghainnean nas ùire fhaighinn. Cuir fios gu IT."

msgid "Settings have not been confirmed up to date for %s days. Please connect to the network; if this persists, contact IT."
msgstr "Cha deach dearbhadh fad %s là gu bheil na roghainnean cho ùr 's a ghabhas. Ceangail ris an lìonra; ma leanas seo, cuir fios gu IT."

msgid "IT is collecting diagnostic info from this computer."
msgstr "Tha IT a’ cruinneachadh fiosrachadh breithneachaidh on choimpiutair seo."
